# Sub-agent worktrees (transient; the branches are the source of truth)
.claude/worktrees/

# Sprint 4b Theme B — IndexNow key file. Lives at data/indexnow-key.txt
# locally for dry-runs; the production value lives in the GitHub Actions
# secret INDEXNOW_KEY. The public ownership file at
# web/public/<key>.txt IS committed (that's the whole point — it has to
# be reachable from the public site), but the bare key value isn't.
/data/indexnow-key.txt

# Sprint 4b fix-pass (nayru P2#5): the pre-launch
# `indexnow-placeholder.txt` was deleted to avoid serving a public
# "no key set" status page. Anyone reading the source can find the
# operator-action runbook in `scripts/indexnow_ping.py`'s module
# docstring. Guard against an accidental future commit of a
# similarly-named placeholder.
/web/public/indexnow-placeholder.txt
/web/dist/indexnow-placeholder.txt




# Local-only agent memory (operationally sensitive notes that shouldn't
# ship to a public repo)
.claude/agent-memory/driver/feedback_oauth_for_anthropic.md

# Launch comms drafts — kept locally only (the operator has working copies)
docs/launch/journalist-outreach.md
/.paircoder/qc/reports/

# Locally-generated /altered/ QC sample report (Sprint 4k-QC). Pure
# convenience artifact: a random-sample-per-bucket markdown summary
# with links for human eyeball review. Regenerate any time via
# `python scripts/altered_qc_sample_report.py`. Not committed because
# the seed is daily so the file changes by date even with no
# underlying data change.
/data/altered-qc-report.md

# Agent-internal memory: notes, audits, and working state from
# specialized subagents. Useful locally for cross-session continuity,
# but contains internal jargon, absolute paths, and occasional
# credential fragments — keep out of the public repo.
/.claude/agent-memory/

# Claude Code's harness creates a per-cwd `.claude/` scope; when an
# agent runs with `cwd=web/` (Astro tooling) the harness mirrors a
# subset of `.claude/` state there (mostly `agent-memory/`). Same
# rationale as the root-level rule above — local-only, never imported.
/web/.claude/

# Per-session scheduler lock the harness drops at the project root.
# Process-local; never relevant to source.
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
